WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
A walker stands four metres from a wall.

2
00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:06.230
First step: two metres, half the gap.

3
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:07.770
Then one metre.

4
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.560
Then half a metre.

5
00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.860
Always half of what's left.

6
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:16.020
The steps get tiny, but there
is always another one to take.

7
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.160
So do you ever arrive?

8
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.800
Never, because the steps go on forever?

9
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.890
Or do you overshoot?

10
00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:26.100
In this mission, you'll
meet geometric sequences,

11
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.430
where each term is the one before
times the same common ratio.

12
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.130
You'll add the terms to
make a geometric series,

13
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.380
and find a formula for its sum.

14
00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:40.500
And you'll use logarithms to find when
a growing total first passes a target.

15
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:44.280
Your mission: decide whether
you ever arrive at the wall.
